    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rope It Two</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wild co-op party platformer for you and your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/1ade96224144c24b8ff5b071250b4749.poster.avif?t=1754913844\" width=478 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/1ade96224144c24b8ff5b071250b4749.webm?t=1754913844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/1ade96224144c24b8ff5b071250b4749.mp4?t=1754913844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1-8 Players Madness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up or compete with up to 8 players in chaotic multiplayer fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/19200b2a487c12741c166225944340f0.poster.avif?t=1754913844\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/19200b2a487c12741c166225944340f0.webm?t=1754913844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/19200b2a487c12741c166225944340f0.mp4?t=1754913844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race, Puzzle, and Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through tricky platforming levels, solve hilarious puzzles, and outsmart your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/954fda7f05010d3fe03774755b7e2dc2.poster.avif?t=1754913844\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/954fda7f05010d3fe03774755b7e2dc2.webm?t=1754913844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/954fda7f05010d3fe03774755b7e2dc2.mp4?t=1754913844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rope It Two</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wild co-op party platformer for you and your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/1ade96224144c24b8ff5b071250b4749.poster.avif?t=1754913844\" width=478 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/1ade96224144c24b8ff5b071250b4749.webm?t=1754913844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/1ade96224144c24b8ff5b071250b4749.mp4?t=1754913844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1-8 Players Madness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up or compete with up to 8 players in chaotic multiplayer fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/19200b2a487c12741c166225944340f0.poster.avif?t=1754913844\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/19200b2a487c12741c166225944340f0.webm?t=1754913844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/19200b2a487c12741c166225944340f0.mp4?t=1754913844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race, Puzzle, and Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through tricky platforming levels, solve hilarious puzzles, and outsmart your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/954fda7f05010d3fe03774755b7e2dc2.poster.avif?t=1754913844\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/954fda7f05010d3fe03774755b7e2dc2.webm?t=1754913844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560100/extras/954fda7f05010d3fe03774755b7e2dc2.mp4?t=1754913844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
